  "pages": [
    {
      "key": "overview",
      "route": "/about-me",
      "frameId": "7:107",
      "title": {
        "path": "about/type/about-title.svg",
        "text": "About Me",
        "width": 308,
        "height": 58,
        "artWidth": 305.0,
        "artHeight": 36.0,
        "offsetX": 0.693359375,
        "offsetY": 9,
        "fontSize": 48
      },
      "titleX": 97,
      "titleY": 103,
      "body": "I’m Ngo Bao Chau, a student at the Foreign Language Specialised School, specializing in Korean.\n\nMy universe begins with curiosity.\n\nI have always been fascinated by the idea of a personal universe, where every planet carries its own story and its own way of seeing. Among them, Uranus has always stood out to me. Tilted almost on its side, it exists from an orientation unlike any other.\n\nThat feels strangely familiar. It reminds me that changing the way we look at something can change what we are able to see.\n\nI see myself in much the same way, not through a single identity, but through different ways of thinking, exploring, seeking, and creating.",
      "bodyX": 97,
      "bodyY": 167,
      "bodyWidth": 452,
      "background": "about/intro-background@2x.webp",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "key": "logician",
      "route": "/about-me/logician",
      "frameId": "7:135",
      "title": {
        "path": "about/type/logician-title.svg",
        "text": "THE LOGICIAN",
        "width": 625,
        "height": 83,
        "artWidth": 619.0,
        "artHeight": 49.0,
        "offsetX": 1.5869140625,
        "offsetY": 15.7001953125,
        "fontSize": 69
      },
      "titleX": 73,
      "titleY": 108,
      "body": "My pursuit of knowledge has taken me beyond conventional learning, from conducting research to challenging myself through international academic competitions such as iCAN and WICO. \nAlongside these experiences, I have earned recognition through various academic awards, each encouraging me to explore unfamiliar questions and approach problems from different perspectives. \nThese experiences have shaped the way I learn, not simply to find answers, but to understand the reasoning behind them.",
      "bodyX": 82,
      "bodyY": 266.66650390625,
      "bodyWidth": 452,
      "background": "about/image-10__7-164@2x.webp",
