    {
      "key": "adventurer",
      "route": "/about-me/adventurer",
      "frameId": "7:176",
      "title": {
        "path": "about/type/adventurer-title.svg",
        "text": "THE ADVENTURER",
        "width": 835,
        "height": 83,
        "artWidth": 831.0,
        "artHeight": 49.0,
        "offsetX": 1.5869140625,
        "offsetY": 15.7001953125,
        "fontSize": 69
      },
      "titleX": 73,
      "titleY": 108,
      "body": "Knowledge becomes different once it is shared.\nA word learned in a classroom can become a bridge. A local tradition can become a story worth carrying forward. I have seen this through teaching English, the Youth for Community Program by Tiền Phong Newspaper, and projects exploring Vietnamese culture and storytelling.\nWhat matters to me is not simply discovering something new, but discovering what becomes possible when knowledge travels.",
      "bodyX": 82,
      "bodyY": 251.66650390625,
      "bodyWidth": 452,
      "background": "about/image-11__7-194@2x.webp",
      "media": [],
      "subtitle": "How I discover the world",
      "subtitleX": 82,
      "subtitleY": 191
    },
    {
      "key": "seeker",
      "route": "/about-me/seeker",
      "frameId": "7:196",
      "title": {
        "path": "about/type/seeker-title.svg",
        "text": "THE SEEKER",
        "width": 559,
        "height": 83,
        "artWidth": 556.0,
        "artHeight": 49.0,
        "offsetX": 1.5869140625,
        "offsetY": 15.7001953125,
        "fontSize": 69
      },
      "titleX": 73,
      "titleY": 108,
      "body": "A birth chart is just a chart.\nFive Elements are just five elements.\nAnd yet, people have built entire ways of understanding themselves around them.\nThat is the part I find interesting.\nI like picking apart the ideas behind astrology, birth charts, and Eastern spiritual traditions, not because I need them to be true, but because they offer another language for things that are often difficult to put into words. The parts of ourselves we notice only when someone gives us a different way to look.",
      "bodyX": 82,
      "bodyY": 342,
      "bodyWidth": 452,
      "background": "about/image-12__7-214@2x.webp",
      "media": [
